        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel Johnson\n- Organizations: Newton Heath, Manchester United F.C., Tonge\n- Places: Manchester, Old Trafford\n- Topics: club founding, name change, player career moves\n\nFacts:\n- Manchester United F.C. was founded as Newton Heath LYR Football Club in 1878.\n- Samuel Johnson was born in Manchester.\n- Samuel Johnson began his career with Tonge.\n- Samuel Johnson moved to Newton Heath in January 1901.\n- Newton Heath changed its name to Manchester United in 1902.\n- Manchester United F.C. is nicknamed \"the Red Devils.\"\n- Manchester United F.C. moved to its current stadium, Old Trafford, in 1910.",
